			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1076405">
									

<p>Nah, given the circumstances I don't think that is so bad. Besides, what will draw more outside attention, a quick airstrike or a sustained artillery barrage? Also given that they never know what will pop out of that location I think the flexibility of air support would be better than artillery.</p>
