			<div class="content" id="post-content-1696821">
									

<p>I always thought it was similar to the redacted weapon used in <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-514">http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-514</a>. Implying the foundation probably has access to some crazy tech-weapons, and whatever team that appeared was one that died while containing a Keter or particular bad Euclid object. I mean, an entrenched battle-ready company took 14 casualties just containing this platoon sized force until air support arrived, there must have been something going on beyond just &quot;this dead MTF with their assault rifles were a bunch of badasses&quot;. It's not a bad expungement.</p>
<p>Edit: Although I guess the casualty figures are left over from when the final one was a Mysterious Horde of 300 rather than an MTF team. I forgot that was what it originally was! I like the dead MTF team better.</p>

